  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 806d4865bd6c6424aac963f21e0e695c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Notes: "This is a handy feature that lets you teleport your player to 5 different
    locations across the level to quickly test how sounds are playing (saving you
    walking to the far end of the map a bunch of times, or repositioning the player).
    \n\nTo teleport in gameplay, simply press 1, 2, 3, 4 or 5. \n\nIf you want to
    change any of the teleport locations, you can simply move the child objects of
    this game object. \n\nMake sure to avoid moving this parent game object, as this
    will change the teleport location of all child objects."
